  "instructions": [
    "Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil.",
    "Cook the linguine pasta according to the package instructions until al dente.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together the olive oil, salt, black pepper, and dried dill.",
    "Add the cooked pasta to the bowl and toss to combine.",
    "Stir in the shredded norwegian cheese until melted and well combined.",
    "Fold in the chopped fresh parsley and green onions.",
    "Spoon the pasta mixture into a scallop shell vessel.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy.",
    "Garnish with additional parsley and green onions if desired.",
    "This dish is best served hot and fresh."
